The community focuses on the assessment and management of swallowing disorders, primarily through the use of Videofluoroscopic Esophageal Dysphagia (VED) and Videofluoroscopic Swallowing Study (VFS). Key entities include medical professionals, organizations, and diagnostic procedures that are interconnected in the evaluation and treatment of dysphagia.

