Researchers such as Moser HW and Rizzo WB have made significant contributions to the understanding and treatment of Adrenoleukodystrophy. Their work has focused on dietary management and the implications of fatty acid metabolism in ALD. The research published in journals like the John Hopkins Medical Journal further disseminates findings that are critical for advancing treatment options and understanding the disorder's complexities. [Data: Entities (11055, 11064); Relationships (6303, 18571, 18573)]

